    "source_turn_preview_server_only": "Small recording devices can remain in a habitat for weeks and collect audio at intervals. This approach is known as passive monitoring, because researchers do not need to stand beside the recorder for every observation. However, microphones can fail, batteries can run out and heavy rain may mask some species, so equipment checks remain necessary."
